  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      If you cannot drop one route after this test, talk it through with someone who sees your marks, budget and family situation together. That is the gap continuous career guidance is built to close: a high-value skill portfolio built over time, not one session.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    The plant side of this fork is in <a href="/blog/career-options/botany-career-options/">botany career options</a>.
  </p>

